TEST 2 — PRECISION LOUPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[!] PHYSICAL FINDING — 2026-09-27:
    Michael reported that during press-and-hold precision placement the post/handle
    remained at the finger and did not appear at the expected location inside the loupe;
    the crosshair and working point appeared misaligned. Test 2 did not pass.
[+] CORRECTION IMPLEMENTED AND AUTOMATED VERIFIED:
    Commit b28ed7c attaches the magnifier to MapLibre's actual render surface, separates
    the loupe-window position from the source coordinate, places snapped fence/corner/
    paddock coordinates under the crosshair before release, commits that displayed
    coordinate, and refreshes after the next render frame so a dragged handle is visible.
    GitHub Actions run 36369176456 (run 145) passed all automated gates.
[ ] Install the exact run-145 field APK before repeating every item below.
