TEST 3 — PADDOCK PLANNING
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ ] Select a pasture and choose Plan Paddock Split.
[ ] Confirm the temporary-plan disclosure appears before saving.
[ ] Place two endpoints on different valid boundary segments.
[ ] Confirm exactly two subtle planning regions and one high-contrast temporary-polywire
