[ ] Hand-check both displayed acreages and their reconciliation to the parent acreage.
[ ] Rename the plan and both sides; save, cold reopen, and confirm persistence.
[ ] Move Start and Move End independently with the precision loupe.
[ ] Exercise Undo, Cancel, and Save; confirm Cancel makes no database change.
[ ] Confirm a second active plan for the same pasture is rejected or unavailable.
[ ] Attempt same-point, tangent, boundary-following, and non-crossing lines; confirm clear
    rejection and no partial record.

TEST 4 — PLAN SAFETY AND FUTURE BLUEPRINT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ ] Edit a parent boundary without detaching either endpoint; confirm the plan remains valid.
